    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir8">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir8-Hd1e98">Caput 8</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir8-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir8-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir8-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir8_1@1-5">Non litiges cum homine potente.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir8-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir8-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e113">Superbo. Unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e115" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov26_4@2-10">Non respondeas stulto juxta stultitiam suam, ne efficiaris ei similis</quote>: quia inter superbos semper jurgia sunt, servum autem Domini non oportet litigare.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir8-Dd1e121">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir8-Hd1e123">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir8-d1e125">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1193D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir8_2@5-5">Locuplete.</quote>
            Qui avaritiae aestibus anhelat. Inde enim oriuntur invidiae, contentiones, et hujusmodi, <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e132" source="http://scta.info/resource/Itim6_10@1-6">Radix enim omnium malorum est cupiditas</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir8-Dd1e137">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir8-Hd1e139">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir8-d1e141">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir8_13@1-3">Non incendas carbones.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir8-Rd1e146"><name xml:id="gom-sir8-Nd1e147" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e150">Unde Apostolus: <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e152" source="http://scta.info/resource/gal6_1@3-18">Si praeoccupatus fuerit homo in aliquo delicto, vos qui spirituales estis, instruite hujusmodi in spiritu lenitatis</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir8-Dd1e158">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir8-Hd1e160">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir8-d1e162">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e164" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir8_15@1-2">Noli foenerari.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir8-Rd1e167"><name xml:id="gom-sir8-Nd1e168" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e171">Unde: Bibe aquam de cisterna tua, et fluenta putei tui habeto solus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir8-Dd1e176">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir8-Hd1e178">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir8-d1e180">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir8-Qd1e182" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir8_17@1-4">Non judices contra judicem.</quote>
            Quasi esto subjectus praepositis et judicibus, qui secundum Deum judicant.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
